  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7469301",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Cyno",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "746930101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "746930101": {
            "id": "746930101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "Are you sure you can't make a copy of this card back for me?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930102"
            ]
          },
          "746930102": {
            "id": "746930102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Barbeloth",
            "text": "Absolutely certain.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930103"
            ]
          },
          "746930103": {
            "id": "746930103",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "Hmm... It's very impressive. Maybe we could come to some sort of arrangement...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930104"
            ]
          },
          "746930104": {
            "id": "746930104",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Barbeloth",
            "text": "Absolutely not.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930105"
            ]
          },
          "746930105": {
            "id": "746930105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "Mm, I see. Obtaining beautiful card backs and playing powerful cards both require a certain price. I think I understand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930109"
            ]
          },
          "746930109": {
            "id": "746930109",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey! You don't know why Cyno's here! Maybe he came here to—",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930110"
            ]
          },
          "746930110": {
            "id": "746930110",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "I sure did. That's my buddy, alright — we're on completely the same wavelength!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930111"
            ]
          },
          "746930111": {
            "id": "746930111",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Seriously!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930112"
            ]
          },
          "746930112": {
            "id": "746930112",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "There's a small gathering of TCG players taking place here in Fontaine. I heard participants get event-exclusive cardholders for free.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930113"
            ]
          },
          "746930113": {
            "id": "746930113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "There were no pressing matters at the Akademiya, so I came over.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930114"
            ]
          },
          "746930114": {
            "id": "746930114",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Even if there were pressing matters, Paimon has a sneaking suspicion you would have found a way to make them... not-so-pressing...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930115"
            ]
          },
          "746930115": {
            "id": "746930115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "You're right! I managed to finish almost all of my work after only two weeks of overtime.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930116"
            ]
          },
          "746930116": {
            "id": "746930116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "Sethos helped out, too, so I promised to bring him a cardholder for his trouble. He's very good at paperwork.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930117"
            ]
          },
          "746930117": {
            "id": "746930117",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Barbeloth",
            "text": "Well then, General Mahamatra, are you going to draw a card or not?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930118"
            ]
          },
          "746930118": {
            "id": "746930118",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "Of course. You say this card will predict my future, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930119"
            ]
          },
          "746930119": {
            "id": "746930119",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Barbeloth",
            "text": "Technically, not quite. But it's unlikely to cause much trouble if you choose to understand it that way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930120"
            ]
          },
          "746930120": {
            "id": "746930120",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "Hm, I see. Is this like that line in \"Duel Master\"... \"Stake your fate on the next card in the draw\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930121"
            ]
          },
          "746930121": {
            "id": "746930121",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "And now it's my turn to draw...!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930122"
            ]
          },
          "746930122": {
            "id": "746930122",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "Cyno takes a deep breath, makes a stylish pose, and draws a card...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930123"
            ]
          },
          "746930123": {
            "id": "746930123",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Barbeloth",
            "text": "Ah, reversed Temperance. A fitting card for the \"General Mahamatra\" of the Sumeru Akademiya.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930124"
            ]
          },
          "746930124": {
            "id": "746930124",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You already know who Cyno is?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930125"
            ]
          },
          "746930125": {
            "id": "746930125",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Barbeloth",
            "text": "Alice mentioned him a few times. She finds it funny that the stuffy old Akademiya has a General Mahamatra with such a \"well-developed\" sense of humor.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930126"
            ]
          },
          "746930126": {
            "id": "746930126",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "Please thank her for the compliment. Now that I've drawn a card, what should I do next?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930127"
            ]
          },
          "746930127": {
            "id": "746930127",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Barbeloth",
            "text": "Since it's reversed Temperance, or rather, reversed \"Artistry,\" I suggest you maintain a state of doing nothing for the time being.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930128"
            ]
          },
          "746930128": {
            "id": "746930128",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Barbeloth",
            "text": "You've been acting rashly and have nearly lost your footing on the narrow bridge of fate.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930129"
            ]
          },
          "746930129": {
            "id": "746930129",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "It's because I've been playing too much cards, isn't it? Sethos and Tighnari told me the same thing — I've already adjusted my schedule.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930130"
            ]
          },
          "746930130": {
            "id": "746930130",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Barbeloth",
            "text": "...I'm not talking about playing cards. I mean your working hours. Surely Genius Invokation TCG isn't the only thing that demands the General Mahamatra's full attention?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930131"
            ]
          },
          "746930131": {
            "id": "746930131",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "My duties don't leave me much room to adjust them...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930132"
            ]
          },
          "746930132": {
            "id": "746930132",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Barbeloth",
            "text": "You're used to bearing the pressure of such a busy schedule alone?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930133"
            ]
          },
          "746930133": {
            "id": "746930133",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "There are other matras. We share the pressure among us.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930134"
            ]
          },
          "746930134": {
            "id": "746930134",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Barbeloth",
            "text": "But they all rely on you? Not just the matras, but the researchers and the people of Sumeru... So many people put their faith in you, General Mahamatra.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930135"
            ]
          },
          "746930135": {
            "id": "746930135",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Barbeloth",
            "text": "They never tell you, perhaps they don't even realize it themselves... Why would they, when they're all so captivated by your unstoppable wit?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930136"
            ]
          },
          "746930136": {
            "id": "746930136",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Barbeloth",
            "text": "But you can feel their gazes, looking to you night and day... Oh, and the shadow that walks beside you. He, too, is one of your burdens.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930137"
            ]
          },
          "746930137": {
            "id": "746930137",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930138"
            ]
          },
          "746930138": {
            "id": "746930138",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Barbeloth",
            "text": "You're used to leading the way, carrying the burdens of others... I think, perhaps, this is the reason for your imbalance.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930139"
            ]
          },
          "746930139": {
            "id": "746930139",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "I have many friends. One of them just happens to be a \"genius\" who goes by the name of \"Invokation TCG\"...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930140"
            ]
          },
          "746930140": {
            "id": "746930140",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Barbeloth",
            "text": "So, it seems you have no intention of resting?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930141"
            ]
          },
          "746930141": {
            "id": "746930141",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Cyno",
            "text": "There's no time to rest.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930142"
            ]
          },
          "746930142": {
            "id": "746930142",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Barbeloth",
            "text": "Indeed. For someone such as yourself, if the inner battle is endless, then even death won't mark the end of duty.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930143"
            ]
          },
          "746930143": {
            "id": "746930143",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Barbeloth",
            "text": "Take this Lunar Arcanum. Perhaps it will lead you to the reason that restores your balance.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "746930144"
            ]
          },
          "746930144": {
            "id": "746930144",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Barbeloth",
            "text": "When it does, the battle within you should also reach a decisive end."
          }
        }
      }
    },
